# Microsoft Office
# website: https://www.office.com
# docs: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/office/
# description: Ignores temporary lock files, backups, and autosave files created by Microsoft Office (Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Visio)

# Temporary scratch files
*.tmp
~*.tmp

# Word temporary
~$*.doc*
~$*.dot*

# Word Auto Backup File
Backup of *.doc*

# Excel temporary
~$*.xls*

# Excel Backup File
*.xlk

# PowerPoint temporary
~$*.ppt*

# Visio autosave temporary files
*.~vsd*